                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]Cuteness Becomes a Headache[/h1]\nTo be blunt, the game is not worth the money for the simple reason of poor game design. I spent more time in this game trying to figure out puzzles presented without explanation than I spent enjoying the actual \"image hunt\" gameplay.\nNot every puzzle needs to be unique, game. Some of these puzzles I couldn't figure out what to do because none of the game's traditional inputs (mouse left/right click) actually did anything in the puzzle!\n\nEven worse it's often hard to tell when you have additional screens on which to hunt for items because the game hates uniform visual design. This isn't fun, but frustrating!\n\ntl;dr - stay away. There are better \"hidden object\" games out there.",
